# Edge case [T3, T4, D2, H]: five edges between one pair mixing solid, dashed, dotted, bidirectional and a reverse edge; all labeled. Stresses lane allocation and arrowheads at both ends of the same pair.
dir DOWN
a[Sender]
b[Receiver]
a -> b : solid
a --> b : dashed
a -.-> b : dotted
a <-> b : both
b -> a : back
